е.","sub":"","before":"Stefan Hell's a","after":"man.","answers":["clever"],"bank":["tall","quiet","clever"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Слова","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"Morocco's a","after":"country.","answers":["friendly"],"bank":["short","friendly","funny"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Слова","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"Birdman's a","after":"film.","answers":["funny"],"bank":["kind","funny","old"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Грамматика","type":"phrases","title":"Послушайте два предложения.","sub":"Два способа сказать одно и то же.","items":[{"text":"She has long black hair.","src":"/learning/audio/a0/700a4f12c935.mp3"},{"text":"She's got long black hair.","src":"/learning/audio/a0/8a2d3cbabe91.mp3"}]},{"stage":"Грамматика","type":"note","title":"has / is при описании людей","sub":"","html":"<table class=\"cp-table\"><tr><th></th><th>Предложение</th><th>Для чего</th></tr><tr><td>has</td><td>She has green eyes.</td><td>parts of the body</td></tr><tr><td>has got</td><td>She's got long hair.</td><td>the same, more spoken</td></tr><tr><td>is</td><td>She is tall.</td><td>tall, young, kind, funny</td></tr></table><p>Для волос и глаз — <b>has</b> или <b>has got</b>.</p><p>Для tall, young, friendly, quiet — <b>is</b>.</p><p>Не смешивайте: «She has tall» — неверно.</p>"},{"stage":"Грамматика","type":"note","title":"Порядок слов","sub":"","html":"<table class=\"cp-table\"><tr><th></th><th>Фраза</th><th>Порядок</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>a tall young man</td><td>size → age → person</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>long black hair</td><td>length → colour → thing</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>a nice quiet city</td><td>opinion → quality → thing</td></tr></table><p>Описательные слова стоят <b>перед</b> существительным, не после.</p><p>Размер и возраст — перед цветом: a tall young man, long black hair.</p><p>К ним не добавляется <b>-s</b>: two tall men.</p><p class=\"cp-note__fwd\">very и really усиливают: really long hair.</p>"},{"stage":"Грамматика","type":"note","title":"Смотрите и слушайте.","sub":"","html":"","examples":["She has long black hair.","He's a tall young man.","They have white faces.","My neighbours are lovely people.","Vienna's a nice city.","She's got really long hair."]},{"stage":"Практика","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"She ___ green eyes.","options":["is","has","are"],"keep":false,"answer":"has","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Практика","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"He ___ tall.","options":["has","have","is"],"keep":false,"answer":"is","why":"Tall — с is.","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Практика","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"They ___ very friendly.","options":["are","have","has"],"keep":false,"answer":"are","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Практика","type":"cols","title":"Внешность или характер?","sub":"","columns":["Как выглядит","Какой характер"],"items":[{"text":"long hair","col":0},{"text":"friendly","col":1},{"text":"clever","col":1},{"text":"tall","col":0},{"text":"green eyes","col":0},{"text":"quiet","col":1}]},{"stage":"Практика","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное предложение.","sub":"","prompt":"","options":["She has hair black long.","She has long black hair."],"keep":false,"answer":"She has long black hair.","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Практика","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное предложение.","sub":"","prompt":"","options":["He's a tall young man.","He's a man tall young."],"keep":false,"answer":"He's a tall young man.","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Практика","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное предложение.","sub":"","prompt":"","options":["They are two talls men.","They are two tall men."],"keep":false,"answer":"They are two tall men.","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Практика","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"He's got","after":"eyes.","answers":["green"],"bank":["greens","green's","green"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Практика","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"She's a","after":"young woman.","answers":["nice"],"bank":["nices","nice","nicely"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Практика","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"My grandmother","after":"very kind.","answers":["is"],"bank":["have","has","is"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Практика","type":"cols","title":"has или is?","sub":"","columns":["She has…","She is…"],"items":[{"text":"green eyes","col":0},{"text":"a white face","col":0},{"text":"tall","col":1},{"text":"friendly","col":1},{"text":"long hair","col":0},{"text":"young","col":1}]},{"stage":"Практика","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["long","She","black","hair.","has"],"answer":"She has long black hair.","why":""},{"stage":"Практика","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["tall","man.","He","a","is","young"],"answer":"He is a tall young man.","why":""},{"stage":"Практика","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["neighbours","people.","lovely","My","are"],"answer":"My neighbours are lovely people.","why":""},{"stage":"Практика","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["She","has","tall."],"bad":1,"answer":"She is tall.","why":"Tall — с is, а не has."},{"stage":"Практика","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["He's","a","man","young."],"bad":3,"answer":"He's a young man.","why":"Описательное слово стоит перед существительным."},{"stage":"Практика","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["They","have","whites","faces."],"bad":2,"answer":"They have white faces.","why":"К описател