cp-who\">Zara</p><p>Hi! I'm Zara. This is a photo of my two friends.</p><p>Ainur is tall and she has long black hair.</p><p>Timur is a quiet, friendly man. He has green eyes.</p><p>They're really funny people. I like them a lot.</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Аудирование","type":"choice","title":"True или False?","sub":"","prompt":"Timur has black eyes.","options":["True","False"],"answer":"False","why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Zara</p><p>Hi! I'm Zara. This is a photo of my two friends.</p><p>Ainur is tall and she has long black hair.</p><p>Timur is a quiet, friendly man. He has green eyes.</p><p>They're really funny people. I like them a lot.</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Аудирование","type":"choice","title":"Прочитайте ещё раз. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"Какой Тимур по характеру?","options":["Tall and young","Quiet and friendly","Funny and clever"],"keep":false,"answer":"Quiet and friendly","why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Zara</p><p>Hi! I'm Zara. This is a photo of my two friends.</p><p>Ainur is tall and she has long black hair.</p><p>Timur is a quiet, friendly man. He has green eyes.</p><p>They're really funny people. I like them a lot.</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Говорение","type":"write","title":"Опишите двух людей.","sub":"Одно — что у них есть, другое — какие они.","placeholder":"","html":"<ul class=\"cp-frames\"><li>My ___ has ___ hair.</li><li>She is ___ and ___ .</li><li>He's a ___ young man.</li></ul><div class=\"cp-note__chips\"><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">has</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">is</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">long</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">short</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">black</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">green eyes</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">tall</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">good-looking</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">friendly</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">quiet</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">funny</span></div>","modelHtml":"<ul class=\"cp-checks